WEBVTT

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.810
Welcome.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.130
<b>Handmade
Scrunchies</b>

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.840
Wow...

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:23.790
I tried incorporating this spring's 
popular designs into that dress.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.680
It's so cute.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.800
Almost done.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.390
I knew I saw something!

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:43.270
That's a nice display.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.600
Mari-chan!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.400
What?

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.820
I need to figure out what's going on.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:51.880
Thank you!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.110
Mari-chan, sorry!

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:56.060
Hey! What are you doing?

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:59.830
If this is because I ate the last 
banana coriander ice cream, I'm sorry.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:04.320
No, Mari-chan. There's 
a deep meaning to this.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:09.040
Even deeper than Roppongi Station, 
the deepest train station in Tokyo.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.250
Roppongi? What?

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.090
Don't ask me now!

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:15.970
O-Okay. I get it, Kotoko.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:20.070
But anyone would worry if someone 
suddenly pulled their hair out.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:22.550
If you do it to Rito too, let her know first.

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:23.870
Got it.

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:25.530
I'm really sorry.

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:29.090
Rito-chan, I'm taking one of your hairs.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:30.490
Don't ask why!

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.210
Ow!

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.150
What's gotten into you?

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:35.610
I'm doing this for you and Mari-chan.

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.720
Sorry. Just trust me!

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.220
Miss Kotoko seems to be 
investigating something, indeed.

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.000
It certainly seems that way.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:30.390
There's nothing in their hair.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.270
In that case...

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.570
Give me your blood...

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.500
I can't take it anymore! I'm too scared!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.210
The Zombie Nurse Strikes Back

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.210
You're the one who said 
you wanted to watch it.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.550
Because zombies are popular right now.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.560
People have even started 
calling them "scary cute."

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:05.680
I thought I'd fall behind the 
trend if I didn't watch it...

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:06.980
But I can't!

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.430
You don't need to force yourself.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.140
That was so scary.

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:18.270
Hey, Mari, about Kotoko... 
I feel like she's been acting strange.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.480
She's been cooped up in her work space.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:26.350
You're right. She is acting like 
she has some strange obsession.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:28.200
She suddenly pulled out one of my hairs.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.160
I wonder what she's doing.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.500
Who knows?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.860
It'd be scary if she said she was researching

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:39.040
the Scoopers, then did something bloody 
like in <i>The Zombie Nurse Strikes Back</i>.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.590
Give me your blood...

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:48.100
What, what, what? What now, Kotoko?!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.940
I already apologized for the 
banana coriander ice cream!

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.140
What's going on?

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.630
Don't ask!

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:55.980
I don't want you to worry.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.520
I'm already worried!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:01.190
Sorry, but you look like 
a zombie nurse to me!

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:04.150
Kotoko scary. Kotoko scary.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.860
Kotoko, why do you need our blood?

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:09.900
I can't tell you.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.080
I'll end up all alone again.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.220
Alone?

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:19.110
N-Nothing. Sorry for scaring you.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.270
I'll go cool off.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:25.470
What's gotten into her?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.800
If she's worried about 
something, we could help.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.400
You're right.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.450
Even if she did stand behind 
me with a syringe in hand,

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:34.320
I should've tried to help her.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.620
Thank you!

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:41.820
<b>Original
T-shirts

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:41.820
All done.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.150
You seem busy, indeed.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:49.620
That's right. I'm so busy, 
I don't have time for anything else.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.230
I'm worried about Kotoko, too.

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:56.160
What is Miss Kotoko doing?

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.690
I wouldn't be worried if I knew.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:01.010
She was up all last night.

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.840
I wonder what she's doing.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:05.920
She was doing something with 
Ebifurya during the night, indeed.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.950
Really?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.320
Mari-chan, Rito-chan.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.350
I changed my mind.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.810
Give me your blood...

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.780
It's the zombie nurse again!

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:20.080
It's Kotoko.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.990
I know that.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.770
That's enough, Kotoko.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.490
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.820
But I really need blood from both of you!

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.160
Kotoko, we get that part.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.660
Tell us why you need it.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:39.640
Well... I couldn't get the hair to work.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:42.210
It has to be blood.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.210
But <i>what</i> wouldn't work?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.670
W-Well...

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:55.420
If I don't figure it out first, 
I'll end up all alone again...

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.720
Kotoko!

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:02.230
Oh, no!

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.190
<b>Original
T-shirts

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.820
Don't worry about the sign. Help Kotoko!

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:09.500
She fell asleep.

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.820
I wish she wouldn't scare us like that.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:19.560
She isn't even twitching.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.710
She must've been exhausted.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.710
What were you doing with Miss Kotoko?

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:29.920
It seems she was worried about their health.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:32.380
Our health?

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:39.350
Yes. She was thoroughly examining 
the components of your hair, yes.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.810
Why would she do that?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:45.770
I'm afraid I don't know, either.

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:49.960
By the way, what's this?

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.680
Oh, th-that's...

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.780
It's cold, indeed!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.370
It's freezing!

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.480
What is this? What's going on?!

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:04.130
Th-That's a freezing bomb Kotoko-sama developed

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:08.800
to defend against powerful enemy attacks.

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.010
She's been researching that?

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.720
I appreciate it, honestly.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:18.060
But I wish she would've told us 
that she made something like this.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.090
And warned us not to touch it.

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:24.480
Between researching this and our health,

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.260
she must not have had any time to sleep.

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:31.240
Yeah, but right now I want 
to jump into a warm bath.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.520
Since Kotoko's sleeping,

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:37.340
why don't we close up for the day and 
visit a public bath while we go shopping?

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:40.330
I wouldn't want to wake Kotoko 
by using the shower here.

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:42.110
You're right.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:47.290
I'll buy her some bone-chillingly cold 
ice cream on the way back.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.310
Oh, no...

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.730
<b>Original
T-shirts

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.440
Rito-chan, Mari-chan!

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:23.350
Rito-chan! Mari-chan!

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.300
Kotoko-chan, is something wrong?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:39.500
I've done something terrible!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:51.950
I always get obsessed when 
I'm curious about something.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:52.900
Uh-huh.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.110
And when I discover something,

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.770
I always want to tell everyone.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.120
I understand.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:05.860
But usually, even if I find 
the discovery interesting,

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:09.270
nobody in my class cares.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.500
My parents are the same way.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.590
They say they don't care, 
it's creepy, or I'm annoying.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.180
I don't have a single friend at school.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:22.140
I see.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:27.200
But when I met Rito-chan 
and Mari-chan in Harajuku,

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:31.170
they both said I was interesting.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.610
They said we should be friends!

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.810
That must've made you happy.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:35.830
Yeah!

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.980
But I think I might be all alone again.

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:45.040
I scared them and did 
terrible things to them.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.250
What happened?

00:10:47.570 --> 00:10:51.580
I was curious about something 
related to our bodies

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.340
and became obsessed with my research.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:58.820
But if I gave them only part of the 
picture and it turned out to be nothing,

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.200
I thought it might worry and disgust them.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:04.020
So I couldn't tell them until I had results.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:04.970
Uh-huh.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.720
But I had to investigate,

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:10.150
so I tried to get some of their blood.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:13.440
They were both shocked.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:14.940
Uh-huh.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:21.180
Later, I was exhausted and lost my balance,

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.950
and I broke Rito-chan's sign.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:26.760
I don't know what to do.

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:34.620
It's okay, Kotoko-chan.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:37.830
I'm sure they'll understand 
if you just talk to them.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:40.970
And Rito-chan wouldn't get 
mad over something like that.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:43.650
You think so?

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.180
I do.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:51.060
You were conducting your research because 
you were worried about them, right?

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.520
That means you were doing it for them.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:57.900
If anything, I'd think they would thank you.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:11:59.780
Really?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:00.940
Yeah.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:04.490
Even though I suddenly pulled out their hair?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.600
Yeah.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:09.830
Even though I asked for their 
blood and waved around a syringe?

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:11.040
Yeah.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:13.500
Even though I broke Rito-chan's sign?

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.460
It'll be fine.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.210
Thanks, Sayumin!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:26.340
You'd better go talk to them.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.750
Yeah. Thanks.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.480
Rito-chan, Mari-chan...

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.360
What's that sludge?

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:58.120
Is that what they call "scary cute"?

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:04.860
It's a bit lacking in the cute department!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.050
It dodged it?

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:09.680
Let me handle this.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.350
It didn't work.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:20.820
Where is it going?

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.510
We have to go after it.

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.670
Rito-chan, Mari-chan!

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.060
Kotoko!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.120
You're awake. Are you okay?

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:36.580
Y-Yeah. Sorry about earlier.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.880
I wasn't trying to scare you.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.400
We know.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.410
But we can talk about that later.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:48.390
Right now, we need you to analyze that 
sludge and figure out where it went.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.090
Okay.

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:55.640
Um... Oh!

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:58.180
It's approaching from the west.

00:13:58.180 --> 00:14:00.080
What? It's coming back?

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.310
I don't see it anywhere.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.630
Distance: 200.

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:04.730
150.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:05.280
100.

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:07.240
100?

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.980
I don't see anything.

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.700
We could see its sludge trail earlier.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:13.630
I don't believe it.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:17.160
Even though it's amorphous, it might 
be moving with a sense of purpose.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.720
I wonder how that works...

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:22.790
It's a liquid, but it moves with purpose?

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.730
It's amazing! I want to research it!

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:27.090
Hang on, Kotoko!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.680
Tell us where it is right now.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.140
Oh, sorry.

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:31.600
Let's see...

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:33.560
Under us!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.850
It's directly beneath us!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:35.890
Directly beneath?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:42.920
Watch out!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.200
Rito!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.140
Rito-chan!

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:51.930
Get away from Rito!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.020
Rito!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:03.950
Rito, are you okay?

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:04.380
Yeah.

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:06.340
Kotoko, let's run!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:09.630
Kotoko!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:13.090
Oh, right. Sorry.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:26.810
It looks like they're losing, indeed.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:30.110
That would be terribly disappointing.

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:32.610
Sorry.

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:36.620
I got obsessed with the sludge again.

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.930
Because of me, Rito-chan...

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.710
I'm really sorry.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.370
I'm fine.

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.670
Right now, let's beat that sludge thing.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:49.130
You can get as obsessive as you want.

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:52.360
You're the only one who can.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.050
Yeah! I'll do my best!

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:03.060
Hey, there's something I want to try.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.440
Absolutely not!

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.330
But if we use this,

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:11.970
I think we'll be able to damage the sludge.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:15.920
I touched it while you were 
sleeping, and it exploded!

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.040
I nearly froze to death!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.470
That's because the safety was off.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:23.970
But right now, it should 
be safe until you fire it.

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:25.000
Really?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.050
Yeah. Just fire it from here.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.670
Okay. Got it.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.300
What should I do?

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.910
Rito-chan, you stay here with Mari-chan.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:36.760
Huh?

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.210
Wait for me to give the signal.

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.700
You're hurt.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.890
Kotoko...

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:44.600
Wait, you're going to fight it?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.400
I have an idea.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.940
Okay, I'm off!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.610
Will she be okay?

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:06.240
Full power.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.380
Will it work?

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.600
Energy

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.300
This is the end!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.810
Wait, wait!

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.260
Mari-chan, now! Aim the cannon!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:32.610
Okay, but I'm not confident 
I can hit a target I can't see.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.060
<i>You don't need to try.</i>

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:37.770
<i>It'll probably dodge the shot even if you do.</i>

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.820
Huh? What are we doing, then?

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:44.270
<i>Well, aim for the Cloud 
Building in Omotesando.</i>

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:45.040
The Cloud Building?

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:50.590
<i>See, this is a strategy that applies 
trigonometric functions, and—</i>

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.390
Okay, just count down for me.

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:56.300
<i>Okay. Get ready.</i>

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:57.640
<i>Here we go.</i>

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:03.310
<i>Five, four, three, two, one...</i>

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:04.640
Zero.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.220
Was that it?

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:16.190
Since Kotoko said it's okay, it probably is.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.030
Yeah, I guess so.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.470
Come on, come on...

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.100
It's done!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.290
How did you do this?

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:05.290
The freezing bomb you fired bounced 
15 times off the various buildings

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.550
and flew up Takeshita Street.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.250
Direct Hit

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.670
You calculated all of that?

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.800
Amazing.

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:14.960
But I'm glad you hit it.

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:18.920
Only you could do something like this.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:22.160
Yeah. Kotoko, you're really interesting.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.570
It's delicious!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:26.640
It's really good.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:30.780
Unfortunately, I couldn't find 
banana coriander flavor,

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.970
but I'm glad we got to eat ice cream.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:37.360
We visited a bunch of stores while you 
were sleeping, but couldn't find any.

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:43.320
What? You didn't leave 
because you were mad at me?

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.920
Why would we be mad at you?

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:50.340
Because I pulled out your hair 
and asked for your blood.

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:52.590
I broke Rito-chan's sign, too.

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:56.720
You did that because you were 
worried about us, right?

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.990
I was surprised by your zombie nurse act,

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:00.800
but of course I wasn't mad.

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:02.760
Mari-chan...

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:06.470
By the way, why did you want our blood?

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:12.440
Well, some marks appeared on
your bodies and disappeared.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:16.920
Don't most marks disappear after a while?

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:20.940
But yours suddenly appeared and disappeared.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.400
I thought it was strange.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:26.240
What? That's scary.

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:29.200
So I thought I should investigate.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.660
We would've helped you if you'd told us.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:37.950
But if it turned out to be nothing, I thought 
I'd just make you worried and exasperated.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:40.040
Then I'd be...

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.040
Kotoko.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:46.000
Mari and I would never leave you alone.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.600
Yeah, of course we wouldn't.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:54.230
Since I tire of things easily,

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:58.520
I think it's great how you can 
focus so closely on a single thing.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:01.210
Yeah. It makes you dependable.

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.240
We love you.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:10.470
I love both of you!

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:13.410
That was a little awkward.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.700
Oh, sorry.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:20.410
I'm going to have another ice cream.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.090
Oh, this one's banana coriander!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:23.300
Really?

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:26.020
They're such good friends, indeed.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.480
Kotoko

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.480
Mari

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.480
Rito

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.940
<b>Warning</b>

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.940
Unknown Substance Detected

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:51.450
No Abnormalities Detected

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:27.010
Help! Help me!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.000
Misa-sama, what's wrong?

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.960
I have a huge problem.

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:31.680
What is it?

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.380
I don't know how much to chew 
a gummy before swallowing.

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:36.970
Chew as much as you'd like.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>illustrated by Ezaki Bisuko</b>
